Package: SlidingDFT
Type: Package
Title: Sliding Discrete Fourier Transform
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Paolo", "Bosetti", email = "paolo.bosetti@me.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maintains a sliding discrete Fourier transform over a fixed-size
    window of real-valued samples, updating all frequency bins in constant time
    per bin for each new sample. Wraps a C++20 library with SIMD (NEON) support.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/pbosetti/SlidingDFT
BugReports: https://github.com/pbosetti/SlidingDFT/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: methods, Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++20
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
